      "topic": "Scalar (dot) product",
      "question": "For $\\vec{a} = \\hat{i} + 2\\hat{j} + 2\\hat{k}$ and $\\vec{b} = 2\\hat{i} + 0\\hat{j} + \\hat{k}$, the scalar product $\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b}$ is:",
