      "topic": "Vector (cross) product",
      "question": "Select ALL correct statements about the cross product $\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b}$.",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "text": "It is anti-commutative: $\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b} = -(\\vec{b}\\times\\vec{a})$."
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "Its magnitude equals the area of the parallelogram formed by $\\vec{a}$ and $\\vec{b}$."
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "It is the zero vector when $\\vec{a}$ and $\\vec{b}$ are parallel."
